      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Semi-related: I ran into someone today whose youtube-dl.exe wasn't working, and the problem seems to have been a Windows 10 update that changed MSVCP100.dll in some way and broke some stuff. I sent him my version from my windows 7 machine and the problem was fixed.\n\nFor him, running the vcredist installer just told him he already had a newer version installed.",
