      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm on a clean install of Windows 10 version 1809 that video panels do not work.\n\nI was able to fix this after downloading and installing vcredist_x86.exe from Microsoft's website and videos instantly starting working in VRChat.\n\nBut this should be checked and installed automatically when VRChat is installed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
